[Music]  a short drive  from downtown boulder city the nevada  southern railway nevada state railway  museum  the rail line was constructed by the  union pacific railroad to  service the boulder dam project and it's  become quite a destination now for a  really fun outdoor activity it's just 30  minutes away from the las vegas strip  hector mejia takes us on board the rail  explorers a  pedal powered rail bike  have you ever thought about taking a  bike ride down train tracks  my inner child's going crazy right now i  used to love trains we're gonna have  so much fun today i just want to be able  to make it back  take a drive down to boulder city and  you'll find rail explorers  the hour and a half excursion promises  the magic of the railroad and nature  with a bit of history it's for all ages  we had a 95 year old lady who was  charged at the break and she goes i'm  peddling this thing i says you go  you have three different tours to choose  from daytime  sunset or an evening ride under the  shining stars  you don't really get to see all the  stars in vegas because it's so bright  the journey takes you on the same tracks  that were used for construction  of the hoover dam back in the 1930s in  an open air car  and then after we have a picnic area  then the historic boulder city train  that used to take everybody to the  hoover dam and all the workers all the  supplies that train comes to pick you up  and then you get to take the ride back  with covet 19 procedures in place  but i'm also the covet lady so we do the  check-in  and we have a couple questions back we  have hand sanitizers they disinfect  the bike we disinfect the chairs we  disinfect the train the restrooms  between each tour  i've never done something like like this  before at all  decided to celebrate our industry  tonight our 12 years anniversary  hector mejia reporting from boulder city  happy anniversary prices start at 85  dollars locals get a 10 percent discount  looks like a fun activity  socially distanced if you will

